---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Our work | Freedom45"
  description="Work by Freedom45 Labs, and what the people behind it have built before: a pre-launch review for a council procurement platform, a proof of concept that became a construction-tech company, and a SaaS scale-up through three funding rounds to acquisition."
  activePage="our-work"
>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">Our work</p>
    <h1>New company. <span class="g">Proven team.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Freedom45 Labs started in 2026, but the people behind it have been building software for years. Here's some of that work.</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Freedom45</h2>
    <div class="stack">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Pre-launch review</span>
        <h3>A procurement platform for UK councils</h3>
        <p>A startup building procurement software for UK councils asked us to check their platform before launch. We reviewed its security, scalability and code quality, verified every finding against the code, and handed over a prioritised risk list and a roadmap to fix it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Before Freedom45, our founders...</h2>
    <div class="stack">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Proof of concept</span>
        <h3>From proof of concept to a new company</h3>
        <p>An R&amp;D tax credit consultancy wanted to break into construction. Our founder built them a desktop app for their claims work, then an AI proof of concept for the new idea. It worked well enough that they invited our founder to co-found the company that grew out of it: CogniBuild, an AI platform for construction, now in trials.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Scale-up</span>
        <h3>Elucidat</h3>
        <p>Our founders worked there in engineering and technical support, from its first full-time developer to Head of Engineering. That meant leading technical due diligence through three funding rounds and its acquisition in 2025, at a VC-backed SaaS platform used by large organisations worldwide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Public sector</span>
        <h3>Council tax fraud detection</h3>
        <p>Co-founded a data analytics startup whose fraud detection tool was trialled by a Welsh city council. It flagged accounts that needed a closer look; the council wrote to them, and some paid what they owed while others updated their details.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Charity</span>
        <h3>A tech education charity</h3>
        <p>Mentoring, help with proofs of concept, and running a hackathon.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Retail</span>
        <h3>A major UK supermarket</h3>
        <p>Maintenance and new features for the intranet its staff use.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Hospitality</span>
        <h3>A café chain</h3>
        <p>A proof of concept for a game-style website and menus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag tag--alt">Agency</span>
        <h3>An ad and marketing agency</h3>
        <p>Extra development capacity, on demand, when their own team was stretched.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1rem">And more: APIs and integrations, price-comparison sites, and third-line technical support.</p>
  </section>

</ContentLayout>
